OL,3,GNEWSAWater supply restored to 7,600
OL,4,Aproperties, firm says
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrinking water supplies have been
OL,7,Frestored to about 7,600 properties in
OL,8,FKent which have been experiencing no
OL,9,Fwater or low pressure, South East Water
OL,10,F(SEW) has said.
OL,12,FMore than 8,000 customers were affected
OL,13,Fby the latest supply disruptions, which
OL,14,FSEW said was a result of prolonged hot
OL,15,Fweather, high demand, pipe bursts, and
OL,16,Fpower issues.
OL,18,FThe company said supplies had been
OL,19,Frestored to properties in Herne Bay,
OL,20,FRough Common and Blean, but urged all
OL,21,Fcustomers to use water for "essential"
OL,22,Fpurposes only.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
