OL,3,GNEWSAWater supply restored to 7,600
OL,4,Aproperties, firm says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 400 properties in Benenden,
OL,7,FCranbrook and Rolvenden are continuing
OL,8,Fto experience low pressure or no water
OL,9,Fand properties in Herne Bay might
OL,10,Fexperience "intermittent supplies"
OL,11,Flater, SEW added.
